{"script":"s_1_20_0","des":"工匠装置的魅力其一 接取步骤","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]这真是难办啊……到底要怎么做才好。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]是这样的。我们是受勒妮他们的委托，来解决篱笆问题的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]小镇的篱笆经常被魔物破坏，每次都是坏了修，修了又被弄坏掉。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]这中间往往只隔了几天甚至几个小时的时间，真的头大，得想办法提升篱笆的质量才行。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]你说你是工匠？有解决的办法？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]只要你能解决这个防卫问题，我们一定会给予相应的报酬的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]如果你们需要了解问题的详情，去问一下勒妮吧。她是镇里最了解情况的……也是最受困扰的。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}